## Model tiering

This workspace uses a three-tier capability model. Tier names (top, mid, light) are capability labels only. Model aliases for each tier are in `.claude/skills/icm-architect/models.config.md`.

**Auto-delegate instruction.** When a task belongs to a different tier than the current model, delegate: spawn a subagent at the appropriate tier, or ask the user to invoke the relevant model directly.

| Tier | Task classes |
|---|---|
| **top** | Planning and architecture decisions; spec authoring; complex coding; verification of mid/light output |
| **mid** | Isolated coding tasks; content production; analysis; multi-file edits within a defined spec |
| **light** | Reading .md files for sync/audit; mechanical transforms; structured data extraction; bulk renames |
